"Disabling is what you almost always want: they stop being able to sign\n"
"          in, and everything they uploaded or wrote stays in the record with "
"their name on\n"
"          it."
msgstr ""
"Desactivar es lo que quieres casi siempre: deja de poder entrar, y todo lo "
"que subió o escribió sigue en el registro con su nombre."

#: .\templates\accounts\editar_cuenta.html:73
